+# Billing disputes
+
+Billing questions are classified by `classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts`. A message containing the literal lowercase text `refund` is classified as `refund-review`; every other billing question is classified as `invoice-question`.
+
+The classifier does not establish refund eligibility, approval, payment status, or invoice details.

